{"id":653060,"shortDescription":"Un metroidvania de sigilo en 2D con plataformas estilo parkour. Explora el majestuoso palacio y las antiguas mazmorras de un reino sitiado. Adopta el papel del legendario Sandfox y aventúrate en las profundidades de las ruinas para descubrir la verdadera amenaza de un mal que procede de la arena.","developers":["Cardboard Sword"],"publishers":["PLAION"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Se recomienda usar un mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"20 MAY 2025","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748340022","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/13ebd2f3f8c4df91d4b1a52c0045c2f37937dca2/ss_13ebd2f3f8c4df91d4b1a52c0045c2f37937dca2.600x338.jpg?t=1748340022","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/13ebd2f3f8c4df91d4b1a52c0045c2f37937dca2/ss_13ebd2f3f8c4df91d4b1a52c0045c2f37937dca2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748340022"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/4c08f7fd6b0eacaa6b1be0771bd8a36c4fa637b2/ss_4c08f7fd6b0eacaa6b1be0771bd8a36c4fa637b2.600x338.jpg?t=1748340022","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/4c08f7fd6b0eacaa6b1be0771bd8a36c4fa637b2/ss_4c08f7fd6b0eacaa6b1be0771bd8a36c4fa637b2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748340022"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/bc3aaffca89c74fae7b21c1a107f65e5fc8ed042/ss_bc3aaffca89c74fae7b21c1a107f65e5fc8ed042.600x338.jpg?t=1748340022","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/bc3aaffca89c74fae7b21c1a107f65e5fc8ed042/ss_bc3aaffca89c74fae7b21c1a107f65e5fc8ed042.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748340022"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/653060/70fb56ccef46f1fbeb22b41dd3add99282e8439e/ss_70fb56ccef